  "description": "ZIRJIV crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C66 H68 Cu4 Dy4 N12 O40,6(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu2 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1D (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy2D (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Cu1D (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu2D (Cu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.478-4.161 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.36-116.14°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Cu4Dy4(vanox)6(Hvanox)2(NO3)4(μ-HOMe)2]·6MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
